    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic world, take the wheel of a tank and become a legendary hunter! &quot;Tank Brothers&quot; is a top-down action roguelike game that combines retro RPG elements, offering you an unprecedented adventure in a world after the end. Recruit companions with unique personalities, gather equipment, upgrade your tank, capture criminals, and uncover the secrets of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Companions: Each with unique skills to enrich your tactical options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful Equipment: Enhance your tank's combat strength to take on stronger enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versatile Builds: Different schools of thought adapt to various tank configurations and pilot setups.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic Boss Battles: Exploit your enemies' weaknesses and outsmart them for victory. Tank Customization: Personalize your tank to boost performance and appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join &quot;Tank Brothers&quot; and pen your legend on the wasteland!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic world, take the wheel of a tank and become a legendary hunter! &quot;Tank Brothers&quot; is a top-down action roguelike game that combines retro RPG elements, offering you an unprecedented adventure in a world after the end. Recruit companions with unique personalities, gather equipment, upgrade your tank, capture criminals, and uncover the secrets of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Companions: Each with unique skills to enrich your tactical options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful Equipment: Enhance your tank's combat strength to take on stronger enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versatile Builds: Different schools of thought adapt to various tank configurations and pilot setups.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic Boss Battles: Exploit your enemies' weaknesses and outsmart them for victory. Tank Customization: Personalize your tank to boost performance and appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join &quot;Tank Brothers&quot; and pen your legend on the wasteland!</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;BROTANK&quot; is a top-down action roguelike game that combines retro RPG elements. Players will adventure in a post-apocalyptic world, recruit companions, acquire powerful tanks and equipment, capture wanted criminals, and ultimately become legendary hunters!",
